Description: A collection of functions for normality testing, data
    transformation, differential analysis with post-hoc comparisons,
    letter-based compact letter display, and a variety of
    publication-ready plots (bar, circular bar, box, heatmap,
    radial tree) targeting environmental monitoring data.
